<title>USA: Rexall Sundown names president to be CEO.</title>
<headline>Rexall Sundown names president to be CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rexall Sundown Inc said Thursday that the company's president, Christian Nast, will assume the additional responsibility of chief executive officer, and Dean DeSantis, the senior vice president, has been promoted to chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Rexall Sundown's founder Carl DeSantis will continue as chairman and remain active in the company.</p>
</text>
